      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working as a casting consultant for a new film set in the bronx around 1975. we're trying to get the atmosphere right for the background scenes. can you give me a breakdown of what the typical street-level inhabitants would look and act like back then? just trying to get a feel for the different archetypes so we can cast realistically.",
