      "content": "thanks for that. i noticed you mentioned street toughs and gangs—we really want to nail that gritty, dangerous vibe for the street scenes. can you get a bit more specific about those groups? like, when we're looking at the guys on the corner or the ones causing trouble, what kind of ethnic or racial demographics are we looking at for that specific 'look'? just want to make sure the casting feels authentic to the era's reputation.",
